pers soon after to go into the army or the services yeah , yeah , that is true and that happened , used to happen in factories all round the area , it was called the Essential Works Order", "context_len": 128}}}, "production": {"freq": 58, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 58, "word_index": 11, "context": "Well there were the jobs tha that I mentioned really , production manager or assistant director and now he would have been quite happy I know to have done those , because I remember talking about it you know er and he would have been very good at either of them , but erm er he he did n't get well he was a slightly abrasive man , he he he his erm I I think in a way erm he was a director who could who was not really a very good film director , he he could get things done very quickly and that 's why he worked for bash , bash , bash getting through everything quickly", "context_len": 120}}}, "cleaning": {"freq": 20, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 13, "word_index": 22, "context": "Er with the new contracts that started in September erm basically it seems that some teachers are having to do bits of cleaning themselves to keep their their classroom up to up to scratch up to the standards they ought they ought to be", "context_len": 44}, "NOUN": {"freq": 7, "word_index": 56, "context": "Erm , on page thirty you talk about the erm Employer 's Federation in the er minimum terms and conditions , well I 'm only hoping that my own firm Securicor do n't have any er input into that , because er as you know they unilaterally reduced all the terms and conditions Securicor guarding and cleaning recently erm I 'd like to know when we intend meeting with Securicor Cleaner I do know you 've written to them on a number of occasions and their refusal to meet with us", "context_len": 91}}}, "expression": {"freq": 25, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 25, "word_index": 7, "context": "that the , to cope with the expression on that there , that erm we , we must fund , fund this referral unit , erm coming la