nly attract British visitors , but", "context_len": 128}, "UNK": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 16, "context": "Staff should be discouraged from carrying over anything more than a few holidays a few days holiday from one year to the next , unless it 's for specific purposes , such as climbing , catching dingo or visiting Aunty Mabel in New Zealand", "context_len": 44}}}, "prompt": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 3, "context": "How could you prompt her to expand on that ?", "context_len": 10}, "NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 28, "context": "I 'd like Elizabeth to bring that forward yep for my benefit , as I know I have n't done it and I 'd like it as a prompt", "context_len": 29}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 21, "context": "On on on that note , can I suggest we adjourn for lunch , meet back here at two o'clock , prompt start", "context_len": 23}}}, "expand": {"freq": 14, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 10, "word_index": 64, "context": "In fact today , this afternoon we 're launching a whole new area at Alton Towers which is additional to anything before erm , Frank referred to it briefly , there 's a Runaway , so called Runaway Train ride , there 's a Ghost House and that 's all part of a new complex , which we 've got longer term plans to expand further", "context_len": 66}, "NOUN": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 0, "context": "Expand that up , you 'll end up with a normal inner leaflet to the membrane , a phospholipids but the outer the , er the outer layer is almost exclusively composed of this stuff , lycropolysacrulite I mentioned this in an earlier lecture but we need to go into in a little bit more detail", "context_len": 56}}}, "emphasize": {"freq": 9, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 9, "word_index": 80, "context": "land outside its current boundary , er located in the Ryedale District Council area , that land , some of that land has planning consent , the remainder is allocated in the draft Southern Ryedale local plan and was excluded from the greenbelt