ectively , I think , I mean I 've never actually sat down because it would be an enormous mistake and nobody would thank me for it , but my guess is that those enormously complex classificated can be understood as a method by which old men rig the system for their own benefit and hide this kinds of ridiculous anonymous and the anomaly basically is the young men end up with old wives", "context_len": 75}}}, "football": {"freq": 51, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 51, "word_index": 86, "context": "I think these proposals not only are a way forward but also in light of what is actually happening in the area of Highfields with er the high numbers of unemployment , with the high rate of people underachieving in education I think for the last two and a half years there has been no clear guidelines or structure that has systematically brought about any results in the two centres to move forward where people have lost out by this issue being bureaucratic and a political football that 's being kicked about and I think it 's about time where we now have cross party consensus that we move positively forward and work towards these proposals", "context_len": 116}}}, "coupon": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 14, "context": "Do you think I would , would n't put an X on a football coupon maybe they do", "context_len": 18}}}, "dilly": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 26, "context": "Your life would never , your life would never be the same , but Jean yo yo you live in this country , you live in dilly forever", "context_len": 28}}}, "forever": {"freq": 8, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 7, "word_index": 108, "context": "'s the conclusion we come to , er late later on , erm and I hope we do , but if we are introducing a new settlement you are bound to skew the building rates , and the more and more you reduce the area in which you consider what the building rate effect is the more and more that it actually gets skewed , er and erm you know , quite frankly , 