, "word_index": 45, "context": "Now , I think there 's probably a very nice parallel here , I ca n't help thinking it was probably a bit better , must have been better organised in the Second World War , but there 's going to be a erm special exhibition here is n't there , on memories of change on Oxford in the Second World War , and of course there were a great many extra people there too", "context_len": 75}}}, "telex": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "And I can remember tenneyex telex coming through and we did our own er er signs in those days , you know , er advertising placards , it was red hot on the press", "context_len": 34}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 9, "context": "a tickatape reading , what er , er a telex type thing ?", "context_len": 13}}}, "placards": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 25, "context": "And I can remember tenneyex telex coming through and we did our own er er signs in those days , you know , er advertising placards , it was red hot on the press", "context_len": 34}}}, "dense": {"freq": 6, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 10, "context": "It 's rather oily and it 's quite a a dense liquid", "context_len": 12}, "UNK": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 17, "context": "Well no , but they wo n't over-densify , they wo wo n't make the population too dense , you see", "context_len": 21}}}, "visible": {"freq": 6, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 6, "word_index": 18, "context": "Well it was er , a dense , thick , curtain , so dense that it was hardly visible , because in those days , during the first world war , during the thirty nine forty five war , blackout was essential", "context_len": 42}}}, "lights": {"freq": 62, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 61, "word_index": 1, "context": "Turbin lights and they were for use of coastal command of the RAF first searchlighting for submarines , looking for submarines , the er the Harvards were very much trained as some of them came in from the Navy they wer