t sausages with bread in it and potatoes mainly you know , greens and things like that were the staple diet but they , they used to get rations apart from people 's personal rations being on war work if you can understand", "context_len": 51}}}, "gluing": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 34, "context": "I shall talk through it and if you can get something written I 'll leave you to do a diagram and you may want to staple this into your book staple 's easier than gluing this", "context_len": 36}}}, "chart": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 11, "context": "Erm if you wanted to get time to look at the chart to colour the planets the right colour that 's up to you", "context_len": 24}, "VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 4, "context": "Put a branch organizations chart up", "context_len": 6}}}, "switches": {"freq": 6, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 25, "context": "Mine , mine was mine was erm if you 've got screw contacts on it , mine have well to say that these er these switches are so unreliable you 'd expect it to be erm", "context_len": 36}, "VERB_PresT": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 22, "context": "Otherwise it 's a slip switch so if you put it in , if I put it in my bag and it switches on and someone else so the the batteries will waste", "context_len": 33}}}, "puzzled": {"freq": 6, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 5, "context": "Erm now , something that puzzled me for quite a long time when I started out doing philosophy of language er one or two years ago erm frequently you hear claims or we hear claims to the effect that this is a logical form of this sentence or this is the structure of this sentence , or this is the semantic structure of this sentence and I was never quite sure what that actually meant erm it 's partly because apart from Davidson , erm a lot of people who write on these issues do n't actually tell you what the background theory is and exactly what the point of the assignment of structured sentences is supposed to be , erm however after thinking about it for a", "context_len": 128}, "UNK": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 19, "context": "the reaction to but if you do see them you should always ask , you say you 're very puzzled are n't you", "context_len": 23}}}, "noun": {"freq": 15, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 6, "word_index": 6, "context": "It might be that the subject noun and verb phrase go together to form a constituent , so you have Florence teased Dougal or the structure might not be that it might just be three separate constituents with no firm structure forming a further constituent , so why that structure ?", "context_len": 51}, "UNK": {"freq": 9, "word_index": 19, "context": "Okay , so the , the reflective pronouns require a C commanding antecedent , antecedent really is just a noun phrase from which it can get its reference like herself back to Florence", "context_len": 33}}}, "sphere": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 24, "context": "The fact that their citizens leak into the city to avail themselves of our facilities is something that we might deal with in another sphere , even on day residents were seen to attend the theatre in this town recently , erm unfortunately this authority does n't see fit to actually subsidise the theatre", "context_len": 54}, "UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 53, "context": "But erm we had a sort of a spectrum you know it covered such a wide well area if you like of er of engineering that one would n't have had a chance to to have a any contact with in in any other works , you 'd be doing as one certain sphere you know a certain type of work , and there you are you that 's your lot eh ?", "context_len": 73}}}, "science": {"freq": 32, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 30, "word_index": 25, "context": "Now that does n't the Kipsigy was just the study of the erm you know it 's a good statistical it 's good hard-hat social science you know with distribution and everything it 's all good stuff , erm