umental in dealing with Robert Maxwell business wherever he was in the world and I mean I 've seen er faxes and cables to France where er that particular director , I believe Mr Shineberg was , I 've seen faxes about Jersey business to Mr Shineberg er presumably er you 're being advised to take that action because in effect it was operating as one operation with transactions routed through New York , routed through London as seemed to suit the circumstances , but not necessarily with any rational basis other than er to avoid perhaps regulation", "context_len": 128}, "VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 30, "context": "Now how is a pensions regulator going to look at those thirty transactions , therefore are you not effectively saying that the pensions regulator may work in areas where pensions regulation actually works now", "context_len": 34}}}, "reorganized": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 21, "context": "Er , Les Echo had problems on the medical side , partly government regulation , partly the market and we 've reorganized er , two medical divisions into one and that should give us er , give us some cost saving there", "context_len": 42}}}, "divisions": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 5, "word_index": 26, "context": "Er , Les Echo had problems on the medical side , partly government regulation , partly the market and we 've reorganized er , two medical divisions into one and that should give us er , give us some cost saving there", "context_len": 42}}}, "bucking": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 9, "context": "The economists had a tremendous year erm , really bucking the trend and contributing about five million pounds to er , F T 's er , associates profits", "context_len": 28}}}, "contributing": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 3, "context": "all you are contributing to the political debate in this country at the present moment is a quarrel about the trade union block vote in 