 that the erm , turnaround in the fortunes of erm , er , B Sky B have been acknowledged and er , I think there has been an element in our thinking that we wanted to keep our dry er , until such time as er , B Sky B which we have great belief and faith in and our , as you know we increased our investment during the year erm , sees its way through to profitability and I 'm happy to say that that 's happening now at a reab reasonable rate and that that means that it is highly unlikely that the hundred and thirty million of guarantees that we still have outstanding to B Sky B are likely to be called", "context_len": 128}, "NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": null, "context": null, "context_len": 0}}}, "profitability": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 80, "context": "or so that the erm , turnaround in the fortunes of erm , er , B Sky B have been acknowledged and er , I think there has been an element in our thinking that we wanted to keep our dry er , until such time as er , B Sky B which we have great belief and faith in and our , as you know we increased our investment during the year erm , sees its way through to profitability and I 'm happy to say that that 's happening now at a reab reasonable rate and that that means that it is highly unlikely that the hundred and thirty million of guarantees that we still have outstanding to B Sky B are likely to be called", "context_len": 128}}}, "sailing": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 17, "context": "Erm , you , a lot of people now talk as though it 's erm , plain sailing or flying for B Sky B and it 's gon na be er , hunky-dory , whereas Anglia Television have just written their stake down to a prenominal amount because they do n't think it 's gon na make , stand a chance of making a profit before the turn of the millennium", "context_len": 71}}}, "millennium": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 70, "context": "Erm , you , a lot of people now talk as though it 's e