ure , you can get by with crude structures that do n't discriminate very much and the same applies to logic", "context_len": 63}}}, "culprits": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 83, "context": "of paper and packages from sweets and cigarettes and things , perhaps maybe because the package industry has developed over the years and that er whereas whenever we had responsibility for taking a small child out , if it had sweets it was encouraged to put the wrappings in its pocket until it got home , now of course it 's encouraged to drop it just where it wants to and er this not only applies to children , some of the worst culprits are the adults who leave the , leave the public houses with a can of beer to drink on the way home and drop it just when they 've finished the last drop of beer or the fish and chip paper 's just dropped", "context_len": 128}}}, "inconsiderate": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 10, "context": "I think this is detracting , I think it 's inconsiderate , it certainly shows a lack of respect for one 's neighbours or indeed for the town one lives in and yet very often I 'm fully aware of the fact that the people who do the dropping are the first to complain that the Council does n't keep the town clean", "context_len": 63}}}, "complain": {"freq": 21, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 19, "word_index": 53, "context": "I think this is detracting , I think it 's inconsiderate , it certainly shows a lack of respect for one 's neighbours or indeed for the town one lives in and yet very often I 'm fully aware of the fact that the people who do the dropping are the first to complain that the Council does n't keep the town clean", "context_len": 63}, "NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 12, "context": "I mean , you ca n't practise piano if people next door complain can you ?", "context_len": 16}}}, "burst": {"freq": 5, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 64, "context": "upon himself , he said I 've not come to condemn t