y , changes , challenges and opportunities in the former Soviet Union and it will be given by the Baroness of Queensbury erm and that 's er at fife fifteen , one four one in this er in this building", "context_len": 99}}}, "sponsor": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 37, "context": "we had a hell of a urgent copy photocopier , and no-one can can do it so we went upstairs photocopy , it 's very urgent , we want it we , want to give to our sponsor", "context_len": 38}}}, "sponsoring": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 8, "context": "Erm I think , well I think 's sponsoring it , erm with John", "context_len": 14}}}, "stealing": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 69, "context": "But we you know , one was one would be boiling the the white metal , we 'd we 'd fixed on the and er one would be boiling and pouring the stuff and the other cutting y you know breaking up the the mould sort of thing and piling the stuff out and as fast as we were piling them up , some beggar was creeping in and stealing them", "context_len": 71}}}, "lapse": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 29, "context": "Erm we 've got some stand alone term insurances which are currently paying one pound ninety , so the moment they increase the policy fee they 'll attempt to lapse so we 're writing to all those people now to tell them to increase", "context_len": 44}}}, "evens": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 7, "context": "On those cases it , it usually evens itself out er it usually says oh due to roundings I 'll ignore that erm cos I 've actu erm I 've gained through the unit statement on , cos I 've had one of these stand alone policies , and not wishing to pay the one pound ninety I 've actually knocked it on the head now and incorporated it with another policy , but erm when we looked at it all , overall I 've got a nil unit situation but in some months I actually had negative units , 