d Freud er , with the idea of writing the book , Freud was apparently feeling very depressed , and er , he was savagely critical of his own work , and er , because he had little access to patients during the war , he generally felt quite down and also by presenting written for him , all he would need to wr all he would need to write , and according to er , other people , perhaps he was eating , he was receiving just sort of waiting to die", "context_len": 101}, "VERB_Past": {"freq": 23, "word_index": 85, "context": "I think it 's a matter of giving yourself time of accepting that maybe you 're feeling low or I fe , when I 'm feeling low I say right , I ca n't cope with things I 've got to give myself some time where nothing 's gon na bother me , if I can manage it , an hour , half an hour , just doing something for myself that I really like and that helps me once I accept myself as being depressed then it helps alleviate the stress involved with it", "context_len": 95}}}, "newness": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 7, "context": "Once you 've er got over the newness of it the the the thing can be put in away in a drawer can be put back in it 's box", "context_len": 30}}}, "masochistically": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 20, "context": "Have we become so depressed about any real prospect of newness that we 've decided to enjoy our chains , masochistically dwelling on our miseries and inadequacies ?", "context_len": 28}}}, "miseries": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 24, "context": "Have we become so depressed about any real prospect of newness that we 've decided to enjoy our chains , masochistically dwelling on our miseries and inadequacies ?", "context_len": 28}}}, "inadequacies": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 26, "context": "Have we become so depressed about any real prospect of newness that we 've decided to enjoy our chains , masochistically dwelling on our miseries an