rtain things", "context_len": 68}}}, "destruction": {"freq": 8, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 8, "word_index": 79, "context": "He really believed that he could do this through , through the form of the Blitzkrieg , that is through a limited war er which would secure military objectives and then produce a political peace and the model er for his er policy was in fact the eighteenth century where many wars occurred between European powers wa impo imperial wars and wars on , on t on er total Europe , but none of these wars resulted in the destruction of any state", "context_len": 83}}}, "technological": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 14, "context": "To meet these aspirations we must make the best use of our human , technological , material and financial resources and this must be done within the framework of a well planned and a well managed system", "context_len": 37}}}, "energies": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 12, "context": "No I 'll just come round you can appear I make the energies move quickly okay ?", "context_len": 17}}}, "solutions": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 9, "context": "erm , other than clairify the erm , all solutions were made available to members of the panel as an appendix to the reports to the Policy Panel er , but that they wo n't to all members efficiency but were made available", "context_len": 43}}}, "fragmenting": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 54, "context": "Now it 's perfectly now the cost er the benefits from sort of marketing right to buy is really very , very dubious erm the government has shown time and again that what it takes then gives with one hand , it takes away with another and the costs are obvious , we are fragmenting our housing stock , we are putting it , we are likely to end up with more and more with a higher proportion of poor properties and erm there 's also the risk that if we do really have to be promoting right to buy we 're going to have people who are probably not sure whether they can afford to buy their house or are n't sure whether they even want to", "context_len": 128}}}, "divisive": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 49, "context": "We could stop pretending that some of us have solutions which are vastly and obviously superior to others , when we all know really that our solutions are not good enough , and in this way you would come together in creative activity instead of fragmenting into ever more divisive and destructive activities which are technically called displacement from one another", "context_len": 61}}}, "bestial": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 15, "context": "A lot to learn from animals including the fact that animals ca n't actually be bestial !", "context_len": 17}}}, "perpetual": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 14, "context": "Centralized government , Whitehall as the founder of all regulation and one party in perpetual power is an obvious recipe for incompetence , even more than it is for tyranny , although bureaucratic tyranny and arrogant assumptions of having no need to listen do produce threats of tyranny", "context_len": 48}}}, "incompetence": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 21, "context": "Centralized government , Whitehall as the founder of all regulation and one party in perpetual power is an obvious recipe for incompetence , even more than it is for tyranny , although bureaucratic tyranny and arrogant assumptions of having no need to listen do produce threats of tyranny", "context_len": 48}}}, "bureaucratic": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 82, "context": "I think these proposals not only are a way forward but also in light of what is actually happening in the area of Highfields with er the high numbers of unemployment , with the high rate of people underachieving in education I think for the last two and a half years there has been no clear guidelines or structure that has systematically brought about any results in the two centres to move forward where people have lost out by this issue being bureaucratic and a political football that 's being kicked about and I think it 's about time where we now have cross party consensus that we move positively forward and work towards these proposals", "context_len": 116}}}, "arrogant": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 64, "context": "is something that , that we have within , it is , it is a quality of life that we possess , because we possess the one who is life himself , listen to what Paul says when he 's writing to Timothy in his first letter in chapter six it is command those who are rich in this present world not to be arrogant or to put their hope in wealth , those who think that , that er in having possessions that is the secret of life or , or in having a good time and , and , and the rest of it that is what life is all about , he said warn them not to do that , because that is so uncertain", "context_len": 128}}}, "restoring": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 3, "context": "In short , restoring ordinary people as part of the we who run things , rather than the them for obstacles to be regulated , managed , I fear even duped and certainly simply left out , and the chief place to focus our search for pragmatic coalitions and cooperative democracy must be in our local communities", "context_len": 57}}}, "regulated": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 23, "context": "In short , restoring ordinary people as part of the we who run things , rather than the them for obstacles to be regulated , managed , I fear even duped and certainly simply left out , and the chief place to focus our search for pragmatic coalitions and cooperative democracy must be in our local communities", "context_len": 57}}}, "duped": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 30, "context": "In short , restoring ordinary people as part of the we who run things , rather than the them for obstacles to be regulated , managed , I fear even duped and certainly simply left out , and the chief place to focus our search for pragmatic coalitions and cooperative democracy must be in our local communities", "context_len": 57}}}, "enduring": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 15, "context": "That is where people live and that is where we must support one another in enduring the present , while we imagine better things , fight for better things and gradually achieve better things", "context_len": 34}}}, "magnificently": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 11, "context": "Were you to turn over that banner which is I think magnificently designed , you would find the other side is entirely about international connections between workers and various groups and so on , so it 's got the international , the wider version and I 'm delighted to to know that you have here , you I understand that the G M B is perhaps the only body which has the nearest thing to a formal alliance with the trade union in Germany I mean this is tremendous", "context_len": 89}}}, "alliance": {"freq": 8, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 8, "word_index": 77, "context": "Were you to turn over that banner which is I think magnificently designed , you would find the other side is entirely about international connections between workers and various groups and so on , so it 's got the international , the wider version and I 'm delighted to to know that you have here , you I understand that the G M B is perhaps the only body which has the nearest thing to a formal alliance with the trade union in Germany I mean this is tremendous", "context_len": 89}}}, "aft": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 15, "context": "When I went to what was in effect not merely the memorial of the fifty aft after fifty two years of the people , but of course really the funeral service of the pit and when I went to that here was the chance to dedicate that also , we did it actually at the Memorial Garden where all the pit people are buried and that is right you see , picking up out of the past not sticking in the past , and arranging it as you might say as in that banner to move on into the future", "context_len": 100}}}, "dedicate": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 45, "context": "When I went to what was in effect not merely the memorial of the fifty aft after fifty two years of the people , but of course really the funeral service of the pit and when I went to that here was the chance to dedicate that also , we did it actually at the Memorial Garden where all the pit people are buried and that is right you see , picking up out of the past not sticking in the past , and arranging it as you might say as in that banner to move on into the future", "context_len": 100}}}, "buried": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 63, "context": "When I went to what was in effect not merely the memorial of the fifty aft after fifty two years of the people , but of course really the funeral service of the pit and when I went to that here was the chance to dedicate that also , we did it actually at the Memorial Garden where all the pit people are buried and that is right you see , picking up out of the past not sticking in the past , and arranging it as you might say as in that banner to move on into the future", "context_len": 100}}}, "romantic": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 20, "context": "So I , I was very moved to find that this has arrived and I do n't think it 's romantic nonsense , I think it is related to the business of getting people together locally", "context_len": 36}}}, "collaborating": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 12, "context": "They find new ways of sharing what resources there are , whether collaborating in local policing or working with health authorities or whatever it is and I think they form the base for renewal of politics because we have to recreate politics for localities upwards and here , just finally chancing my arm , I must just frankly say that I am not clear that over-large amalgamations of unions will be much more helpful than over-centralized government bureaucracies", "context_len": 78}}}, "policing": {"freq": 7, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 3, "word_index": 15, "context": "They find new ways of sharing what resources there are , whether collaborating in local policing or working with health authorities or whatever it is and I think they form the base for renewal of politics because we have to recreate politics for localities upwards and here , just finally chancing my arm , I must just frankly say that I am not clear that over-large amalgamations of unions will be much more helpful than over-centralized government bureaucracies", "context_len": 78}, "VERB_PresC": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 106, "context": "Can I can I say that in my opinion that the county council 's current budgeting strategy which effectively imposes a two percent efficiency saving which I might add in figures come to something like one point five million erm is , is of concern but what is of greater concern is the further possibility of a four percent er reduction which is being sought in blocks of three percent and one percent next year for ninety four ninety five which is to the amount of two point eight million at the current prices will in my opinion decimate the present level of service provision in policing", "context_len": 107}}}, "recreate": {"freq": 4, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 4, "word_index": 53, "context": "Erm , it , what it struck me as is a parallel with Freud 's idea of transference , you know that once something happens in the , in the traumatic period in a , in a childhood , there 's then a tendency to transference to occur later in life , we recreate later in relationships to er the model of the early one and er it struck me that what you said about French industrial relations sounded a bit like transference in erm in the psychoanalysis the idea that i i it spills out as it were from the initial which might have been saved er within the family to other relationships i in later life that people have with their superiors at work or something", "context_len": 128}}}, "chancing": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 50, "context": "They find new ways of sharing what resources there are , whether collaborating in local policing or working with health authorities or whatever it is and I think they form the base for renewal of politics because we have to recreate politics for localities upwards and here , just finally chancing my arm , I must just frankly say that I am not clear that over-large amalgamations of unions will be much more helpful than over-centralized government bureaucracies", "context_len": 78}}}, "amalgamations": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 66, "context": "They find new ways of sharing what resources there are , whether collaborating in local policing or working with health authorities or whatever it is and I think they form the base for renewal of politics because we have to recreate politics for localities upwards and here , just finally chancing my arm , I must just frankly say that I am not clear that over-large amalgamations of unions will be much more helpful than over-centralized government bureaucracies", "context_len": 78}}}, "bureaucracies": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 77, "context": "They find new ways of sharing what resources there are , whether collaborating in local policing or working with health authorities or whatever it is and I think they form the base for renewal of politics because we have to recreate politics for localities upwards and here , just finally chancing my arm , I must just frankly say that I am not clear that over-large amalgamations of unions will be much more helpful than over-centralized government bureaucracies", "context_len": 78}}}, "sacred": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 16, "context": "One of the advantages of not knowing too much about things is that you can keep sacred cows in the without noticing", "context_len": 22}, "VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "This the special , almost sacred being", "context_len": 7}}}, "cows": {"freq": 7, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 7, "word_index": 80, "context": "He asked me whether I was a country person I asked what the qualifications were he said country born and bred , well I was born in Liverpool spent my childhood and early adolescence in rural Nottinghamshire , moved to Highfields , emigrated to the West Indies and now live in sub rural Blavey so I do n't know whether I qualify as a country person or not , but I 'd like to bet that I 've milked more cows by hand than he has if that 's any qualification", "context_len": 91}}}, "noticing": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 21, "context": "One of the advantages of not knowing too much about things is that you can keep sacred cows in the without noticing", "context_len": 22}}}, "complication": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 6, "context": "Of course we have the additional complication that the over- large government bureaucracy 's at present run by a political party which seems to have given up thinking about anything much other than staying in power and I know and hope that you will be part of thinking about much more than that , but still even with a large union , you could regulate concentrate on stimulating the grass roots and then on building upwards", "context_len": 76}}}, "stimulating": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 67, "context": "Of course we have the additional complication that the over- large government bureaucracy 's at present run by a political party which seems to have given up thinking about 