ate 's , which again , that gives us a great deal about the insight as to what it was like there", "context_len": 66}}}, "findings": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 40, "context": "People are anyway going to try and look for , lo look for explanations , and it may be that , you know , in fifty or a hundred years ' time , peoples insight into , into Freud 's findings are different", "context_len": 43}}}, "misunderstood": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 10, "context": "To such a large extent some of the things were misunderstood that he discovered", "context_len": 14}}}, "idealize": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 17, "context": "So they , so do you think there 's a tendency for Americans still to kind of idealize Wilson , but for Europeans to be a bit more cynical", "context_len": 29}}}, "blackest": {"freq": 3, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 27, "context": "As we 'll see another if this was a black book of Freud 's , and in some ways you would say this was one of the blackest", "context_len": 28}, "NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": null, "context": null, "context_len": 0}}}, "commence": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 5, "context": "Colleagues just before we er commence with today 's business , one or two announcements to make", "context_len": 17}, "VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 29, "context": "Because of his speed and er Th certainly this one here , I mean the Highway Code says that you must make sure that it 's safe before you commence an overtaking manoeuvre", "context_len": 33}}}, "foolishly": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 26, "context": "You 'll remember yesterday that we had the collection for the Crawley Strikers and that the General Secretary , rather , I was gon na say foolishly then , generously er said that we would double whatever was collected", "context_len": 39}}}, "generously": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index"