ion , if we need outside help , be there and there 's no shame in it ?", "context_len": 128}}}, "blues": {"freq": 15, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 15, "word_index": 29, "context": "I mean , you think you give birth and you 're forgotten , I mean your health visitor visits your baby , and then you 've got the baby blues , and we we are trying to do something to get them to help and warn people about when they are pregnant it can happen because it does start then , not after you 've had the baby , it builds up and them wham , it hits you !", "context_len": 80}}}, "manic": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 4, "context": "You know , a manic depressive or a schizophrenic or whatever", "context_len": 11}}}, "schizophrenic": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"UNK": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 8, "context": "You know , a manic depressive or a schizophrenic or whatever", "context_len": 11}}}, "depresses": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresT": {"freq": 2, "word_index": null, "context": null, "context_len": 0}}}, "strengths": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 40, "context": "Erm , one of the things that depresses me , is probably the main thing that depresses me is not being valued for what I am or what I do and I think many women suffer from depression because their strengths and their creativity are not recognised and valued", "context_len": 49}}}, "creativity": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 43, "context": "Erm , one of the things that depresses me , is probably the main thing that depresses me is not being valued for what I am or what I do and I think many women suffer from depression because their strengths and their creativity are not recognised and valued", "context_len": 49}}}, "imbalances": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 45, "context": "I think it helps if you can identify whether the the erm depression is just caused by erm the circumstances round about you which can be alleviated by changing them or 