ical precedent ?", "context_len": 53}}}, "revolutions": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 36, "context": "another revolution I mean that the fight that none , none of these things have really come to a full success , yeah , so nobody looks at them and says well we need no more revolutions because they 'll all work", "context_len": 42}}}, "inaugurated": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB_Past": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 27, "context": "I think that now he 's in office and this is why I 've started to dislike him a little more since he 's been you know inaugurated even", "context_len": 29}}}, "strung": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 1, "word_index": 35, "context": "Right , he probably does think that , but is n't it interesting er does n't this illustrate the point we 've been making that he felt he needed to have a play that , strung that historical cord as it were", "context_len": 42}}}, "deduce": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 8, "context": "So perhaps in some ways er we would deduce from this that the the motive of the revolutionaries in sixty eight was in perhaps to some extent to complete what had been started in seventeen eighty nine but not finished and somebody would , Clinton presumably he would say I 'm gon na complete the programme that John F Kennedy started , but was unable to finish because the tragic way in which his career was ended", "context_len": 77}}}, "condoning": {"freq": 2, "POS": {"VERB_PresC": {"freq": 2, "word_index": 32, "context": "However if you say erm oh well you know erm boys will be boys that 's natural , tha that sounds as if you 're kind of making excuses for them and condoning them , so I think you 've got to be very careful about how you use the word natural and clearly it raises the whole question of how far you can , you can push erm cultural ideals against natural constraints an and what really is the issue", "context_len": 81}}}, "crusades": {"freq": 1, "POS": {"NOUN_P": {"freq": 1, "w